      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِدْحٌ أَخْيَبُ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>An arrow of those employed in
the game called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَيْسِر</span>, <i>to which no lot,</i> or <i>portion,
pertains:</i> for there are three such arrows; namely,
the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنِيح</span>, the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفِيح</span>, and the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَغْد</span>: occurring in
a trad. of 'Alee. (TA.)

